        "created_at": "2021-03-06T09:01:11.014Z",
        "cooked": "<p>You are definitely correct, though I don’t think that makes sense every time. Sometimes the penalty should wait since it could be very specific and anot make sense to apply just yet. Might house rule it, though I am generslly against that.</p>",
