      {
        "id": 235712,
        "name": "catDreaming",
        "username": "catDreaming",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/4491bb/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2021-03-06T23:38:55.596Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I was unclear. When I said ‘applicable’, I was referring to the case of multiple exclusive penalties, not narrative applicability. If it’s not exclusive, and it’s a penalty it <span class=\"bbcode-i\">must</span> be used at the earliest oppurtunity.</p>",
